    rdfs:label "FAIRification";
    skos:definition "A process that transforms non-FAIR or partially FAIR resources into standardized, machine-actionable digital resources (called FAIR Digital Objects) by assigning global, unique and persistent identifiers and associating explicit metadata based on FAIR Supporting Resources as defined in a FAIR Implementation Profile (FIP)." .
}

